<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    {{> layout/head-meta}}
    <title>기업 마이페이지</title>
</head>
<body>
{{>layout/header}}
{{> layout/company-style}}
{{> layout/account-style}}
<style>
    .company-home {
        padding: 40px 24px 60px;
        background: #f8f9fb;
        color: #292f3d;
        font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
    }

    .company-home .company-card {
        max-width: none;
        width: 100%;
        padding: 30px;
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid #e6e7eb;
        border-radius: 18px;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 16px rgba(30, 35, 45, .025);
    }

    .company-home .company-card h1 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
    }

    .company-home .company-card h2 {
        margin: 26px 0 16px;
        font-size: 24px;
    }

    .company-home .company-card dl {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 140px minmax(0, 1fr);
        margin: 0;
    }

    .company-home .company-card dt, .company-home .company-card dd {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 15px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #ececef;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.7;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .company-home .company-card dt {
        color: #72757e;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .company-home .company-card > p {
        color: #72757e;
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .company-home .company-note {
        padding: 18px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #f3efe8;
        color: #64615a;
        font-size: 13px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin: 24px 0;
    }

    .company-home .company-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 12px;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .company-home .company-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border: 1px solid #0750d8;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #0750d8;
        color: white;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .company-home .company-link.secondary {
        background: white;
        color: #555c68;
        border-color: #d9dbe1;
    }

    .company-home .company-point-card { margin: 24px 0; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e7e1d7; border-radius: 16px; background: #f3efe8; }
    .company-home .company-point-card h2 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; }
    .company-home .company-point-balance { display: block; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 30px; letter-spacing: -.7px; color: #292f3d; }
    .company-home .company-point-card p { margin: 0 0 18px; color: #72716e; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        .company-home {
            padding: 28px 16px 40px;
        }

        .company-home .company-card {
            padding: 22px;
        }

        .company-home .company-card dl {
            grid-template-columns: 110px minmax(0, 1fr);
        }
    }

    .company-review-feedback {
        margin: 20px 0;
        padding: 18px 20px;
        border: 1px solid #f2c5c5;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #fff5f5;
        color: #912626;
    }

    .company-review-feedback p {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

</style>
<main class="company-home">
    <div class="account-layout">
        {{> layout/company-nav}}
        <section class="company-card account-content">

            <span class="member-eyebrow">BUSAN PLAY · PARTNERS</span>
            <h1>기업 정보</h1>
            <p>등록된 기업 정보와 심사 상태를 확인하고 관리하세요.</p>

            {{#company}}

                {{#reviewReason}}
                <div class="company-review-feedback" role="note">
                    <strong>관리자 보완 요청</strong>
                    <p>{{reviewReason}}</p>
                </div>
                {{/reviewReason}}

                <section class="company-point-card" aria-labelledby="company-point-title">
                    <h2 id="company-point-title">보유 포인트</h2>
                    <strong class="company-point-balance">{{pointText}}</strong>
                    <p>행사 승인 후 보증금 결제에 사용할 수 있는 기업 포인트입니다.</p>
                    <a class="company-link" href="/charge">포인트 충전하기 →</a>
                </section>
                <h2>{{name}}</h2>

                <dl>
                    <dt>이메일</dt>
                    <dd>{{email}}</dd>

                    <dt>사업자등록번호</dt>
                    <dd>{{businessNumber}}</dd>

                    <dt>대표자명</dt>
                    <dd>{{representativeName}}</dd>

                    <dt>기업 주소</dt>
                    <dd>{{address}}</dd>

                    <dt>담당자 이름</dt>
                    <dd>{{contactPersonName}}</dd>

                    <dt>담당자 연락처</dt>
                    <dd>{{contactPersonPhone}}</dd>

                    <dt>기업 심사 상태</dt>
                    <dd>
                        {{#pending}}
                            <span class="review-badge review-badge--pending">검토 중</span>
                        {{/pending}}

                        {{#approved}}
                            <span class="review-badge review-badge--approved">승인</span>
                        {{/approved}}

                        {{#feedbackNeeded}}
                            <span class="review-badge review-badge--danger">보완 필요</span>
                        {{/feedbackNeeded}}

                        {{#rejected}}
                            <span class="review-badge review-badge--danger">반려</span>
                        {{/rejected}}

                        {{#suspended}}
                            <span class="review-badge review-badge--danger">이용 정지</span>
                        {{/suspended}}
                    </dd>
                </dl>
            {{/company}}

            <div class="company-note">등록된 기업 정보와 담당자 정보를 수정할 수 있습니다.<br>기업 인증 정보를 변경하면 새 사업자등록증 제출과 재심사가 필요합니다.</div>
            <div class="company-actions"><a class="company-link" href="/company/update">기업 정보 수정</a><a
                    class="company-link secondary" href="/">메인으로 이동</a></div>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>

{{>layout/footer}}
</body>
</html>